    <title>BC Securities Commission | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="BC Securities Commission | 6,651 followers on LinkedIn. The BC Securities Commission (BCSC) fosters fair and efficient investment markets – enabling people to achieve their financial goals, enterprises to grow, and British Columbia to thrive. Through smart rules, diligent oversight, strong enforcement and reliable guidance, we act as guardians of the province’s investment marketplace, striving to make BC a place where people can invest with confidence and companies can flourish.">

