    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-10-06T21:28:42.618Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":13},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_worldinvestorweek-investoreducationmonth-activity-7513349544194244610-FKO5","text":"🎙️ New Podcast Series: Click, Hype, Invest \n\nFrom social media trends to gamified investing experiences, investors are navigating a rapidly changing information landscape. \nHosted by Pamela McDonald, Click, Hype, Invest features: \nJulia and Philip Olson of PBS's Two Cents \nDr. Marius Zoican, University of Calgary \nMeera Raman, The Globe and Mail \nWatch the full series: https://lnkd.in/enKs85uN\n\n#WorldInvestorWeek #InvestorEducationMonth ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_worldinvestorweek-investoreducationmonth-activity-7513349544194244610-FKO5"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-10-06T15:01:39.215Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":32},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_the-bc-securities-commission-bcsc-is-seeking-activity-7513252138177765376-JMJH","text":"The BC Securities Commission (BCSC) is seeking an accomplished and strategic Chief Financial Officer (CFO) to join its executive leadership team. \n\nReporting to the Executive Director, the CFO serves as a trusted advisor to the Chief Executive Officer, Executive Director and senior leadership team and plays a critical role in shaping organizational strategy, resource allocation, financial sustainability, and enterprise risk management. The CFO oversees Financial Services, Procurement, and Facilities and helps ensure the Commission has the resources, infrastructure, and financial stewardship necessary to fulfill its public mandate. \n\nThe BCSC is partnering with Korn Ferry, an external recruitment firm on this search. To explore this opportunity, please see out web page for more details. https://lnkd.in/eBjuivU2","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_the-bc-securities-commission-bcsc-is-seeking-activity-7513252138177765376-JMJH"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-09-25T21:14:21.341Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":7},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_during-the-provincial-election-period-bc-activity-7509359665210724352-WVUG","text":"During the provincial election period, BC Securities Commission communications will be limited. Visit our website for service and program information. Direct questions, complaints or concerns to BCSC Inquiries: inquiries@bcsc.bc.ca, or 1-800-373-6393 (toll free in Canada). https://www.bcsc.bc.ca/. Regular posting will resume after the election.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_during-the-provincial-election-period-bc-activity-7509359665210724352-WVUG"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-09-22T16:01:05.825Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_bcsc-investorprotection-fraudawareness-activity-7508193667514511360-KnwE","text":"🌐 In a global information economy, investment solicitations can come from anywhere — and not all of them are legitimate.\n\n⚠️ Scam artists may impersonate real organizations, misuse logos, or use fake testimonials from well-known individuals to appear credible.\nThey might even reference actual financial institutions or registered professionals to gain your trust.\n\n🔍 The BC Securities Commission maintains the Investment Caution List (ICL) — a resource to help you identify unregistered and unqualified investment opportunities being offered in British Columbia.\n\n✅ Checking the ICL before you invest is a good place to start: https://lnkd.in/gX-VUd6D\n#BCSC #InvestorProtection #FraudAwareness","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_bcsc-investorprotection-fraudawareness-activity-7508193667514511360-KnwE"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-09-21T16:05:18.300Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_securitiesregulation-legalcompliance-bcsc-activity-7507832338664431616-KOLO","text":"📣Stay informed about  regulatory news. The BCSC weekly summary on securities regulation and enforcement actions in British Columbia is now available. Explore our latest Weekly Report from the week ending on September 18, 2026.\n\nLast week's updates:\n📜 Instruments & Policies – 1 update\n📰 News Release – 2 published\n⚖️ Decisions, Settlements, Hearings & Temporary Orders – 2 published\n \n🔗 Access the latest report here: https://lnkd.in/dD8h9eVp\n\n#SecuritiesRegulation #LegalCompliance #BCSC #PublicCompanies #CorporateLaw","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_securitiesregulation-legalcompliance-bcsc-activity-7507832338664431616-KOLO"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-09-17T19:26:29.903Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":33},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_marita-bruun-from-the-bc-securities-commission-activity-7506433419170701313-VwXX","text":"Marita Bruun, from the BC Securities Commission HR team recently presented at 2026 Indigenous Human Resources Conference in Vancouver. Marita focused on employee retention and developing clear HR policies in her talk: \"Beyond Recruitment: Creating the Conditions That Encourage People to Stay.\" Thanks to AFOA BC for hosting.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_marita-bruun-from-the-bc-securities-commission-activity-7506433419170701313-VwXX"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission"},"datePublished":"2026-09-17T16:15:14.530Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_bcsc-publiccompanies-capitalmarkets-activity-7506385287975976960-Z8Iq","text":"At the BC Securities Commission, we know that strong governance and regulatory compliance are essential to maintaining confidence in Canada's capital markets.\n\nThat's why we're pleased to support Simon Fraser University's continuing studies offering: Public Companies: Financing, Governance and Compliance alongside the Toronto Stock Exchange and TSX Venture Exchange.\n\nThe course features expertise from BCSC presenters who share valuable perspectives on corporate governance, securities regulation, investor relations, financial reporting, insider obligations, exchange requirements, and directors' responsibilities.\n\nWhether you're a director, officer, corporate secretary, or advisor, this program will help you navigate Canada's complex securities regulatory environment with confidence.\n\nhttps://lnkd.in/gnmCbrsK\n\n#BCSC #PublicCompanies #CapitalMarkets #Governance #Compliance #TSX #TSXV #InvestorConfidence","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-columbia-securities-commission_bcsc-publiccompanies-capitalmarkets-activity-7506385287975976960-Z8Iq"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"BC Securities Commission","url":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/british-columbia-securities-commission","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"701 West Georgia Street","addressLocality":"Vancouver","addressRegion":"British Columbia","addressCountry":"CA"},"description":"The BC Securities Commission (BCSC) fosters fair and efficient investment markets – enabling people to achieve their financial goals, enterprises to grow, and British Columbia to thrive. Through smart rules, diligent oversight, strong enforcement and reliable guidance, we act as guardians of the province’s investment marketplace, striving to make BC a place where people can invest with confidence and companies can flourish.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":297,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHBi7limzqy_g/company-logo_200_200/B56Z_NqtVOGUAI-/0/1785861953036/british_columbia_securities_commission_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-1YYgvmVtwvEi5h4v7H3hYicwTunRn58XOUXLbCZH8s","description":"BC Securities Commission","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"http://www.bcsc.bc.ca/"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
