    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">The BC Securities Commission (BCSC) is seeking an accomplished and strategic Chief Financial Officer (CFO) to join its executive leadership team. 

Reporting to the Executive Director, the CFO serves as a trusted advisor to the Chief Executive Officer, Executive Director and senior leadership team and plays a critical role in shaping organizational strategy, resource allocation, financial sustainability, and enterprise risk management. The CFO oversees Financial Services, Procurement, and Facilities and helps ensure the Commission has the resources, infrastructure, and financial stewardship necessary to fulfill its public mandate. 

The BCSC is partnering with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/kornferry?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Korn Ferry</a>, an external recruitment firm on this search. To explore this opportunity, please see out web page for more details. <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eBjuivU2?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eBjuivU2</a></p>
