        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Marita Bruun, from the BC Securities Commission HR team recently presented at 2026 Indigenous Human Resources Conference in Vancouver. Marita focused on employee retention and developing clear HR policies in her talk: "Beyond Recruitment: Creating the Conditions That Encourage People to Stay." Thanks to <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/afoa-bc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>AFOA BC</a> for hosting.</p>
